    "response": "{\"decision\":\"established_flaw\",\"issues\":[{\"category\":\"unsupported_inference\",\"target_kind\":\"assertion\",\"claim_quote\":\"Policy debate functions as a generalized rupture in civic selfhood and social order across the packet.\",\"evidence\":[{\"excerpt_id\":\"EXC_7fd81a67aeda76d5\",\"quote\":\"Many of my constituents cannot afford to buy a house of their own and are finding that private sector landlords are using various devices to block access to that market as well, such as through guarantees and bond requirements, so council housing or social housing is the only option, but demand is outstripping supply…\"},{\"excerpt_id\":\"EXC_1a83ad591d096fab\",\"quote\":\"It is not for me to say what decision the decision maker should come to…\"},{\"excerpt_id\":\"EXC_e88b416637c6f6d6\",\"quote\":\"Youth unemployment is rising and one route out of this is through apprenticeships…\"},{\"excerpt_id\":\"EXC_6fd9d8a7804688bb\",\"quote\":\"I welcome the use of private sector capital…\"},{\"excerpt_id\":\"EXC_6fd9d8a7804688bb\",\"quote\":\"Local partnerships and private sector competitors can bring these about as long as they are not thwarted from the centre…\"}],\"whole_packet_no_support\":\"whole_packet_no_support\",\"mechanism\":\"The claim makes a broad, unsupported assertion about 'a generalized rupture'. The evidence details specific issues (housing shortages, apprenticeship poverty) without establishing a systemic 'rupture' in civic selfhood or social order.\",\"material_consequence\":\"The claim lacks evidentiary support for a fundamental breakdown of civic structures; it’s an overinterpretation of localized problems.\",\"counterconditions\":\"No counterconditions provided. The evidence does not present a case against the claim’s core assertion.\"}],\"unresolved\":[],\"rationale\":\"The claim presents an expansive interpretation of policy debate’s impact, unsupported by the provided evidence which focuses on specific, localized issues. The evidence does not demonstrate a widespread 'rupture' in civic selfhood or social order.\"}",
    "done": true,
    "done_reason": "stop",
